<th id="S4.T3.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">GPT-4o <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib15" title="" class="ltx_ref">OpenAI, 2025</a>)</cite></th>
